# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEXT COHORT DATE  ←  THE ONLY THING TO ADD
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# YYYY-MM-DD in East Africa Time (UTC+03:00). Set this to confirm the next
# cohort start date. The admin adds exactly this one value and everything
# else follows automatically:
#
#   - enrollment deadline  = cohort start - 3 days
#   - seats left           = 0..24, seeded by the cohort week
#   - countdown            = "2d 15h left" / "15h 30m left" / "45m left"
#
# When the enrollment deadline passes the schedule rolls forward to the next
# cohort on its own, so the site never shows a dead "Enrolment closed" state
# — it always points at the next thing to add.
#
# Leave it unset until the cohort date is confirmed; the site then advertises
# the next Monday as a rolling cohort.
VITE_NEXT_COHORT_START_DATE=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Booking submission endpoint
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# URL that accepts a form-encoded POST and emails the inquiry to CS
# Academy support. The recipient is the email embedded in the URL.
#
# We use formsubmit.co — a serverless, no-account form-to-email service.
#
# Example values:
#   formsubmit.co (no backend):  https://formsubmit.co/ajax/support@cyberswahili.co.tz
#     -> the support email receives every submission
#     -> on the FIRST submission, formsubmit emails that address a
#        one-time "Activate Form" link; click it once to enable
#     -> enable Auto-Response on formsubmit's confirmation page so the
#        user (via the form's `email` field) also gets a copy
#   Custom serverless:           https://academy.cyberswahili.co.tz/api/booking
#
# When this value is empty the BookingModal uses the CS Academy support
# address above. Override only when using another verified endpoint.
VITE_BOOKING_ENDPOINT=